  "description": "<p>Discover something new and exciting with Grand Random Steam Games — the perfect choice for players who love surprises without compromising on quality. With every purchase, you’ll receive a randomly selected Steam game that meets strict quality standards, ensuring a fun and worthwhile addition to your library. Whether you’re exploring new genres, building your collection, or simply enjoying the thrill of mystery, this product delivers great value and exciting gameplay experiences every time.</p>\n<p>Unlike typical random bundles, every game included in this offer is carefully selected based on real player feedback and popularity. That means no low-effort or poorly rated titles — only games that players genuinely enjoy.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>What You’ll Get?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Random Steam Game added to your collection</li>\n<li>Each game has at least 1,000 reviews on Steam</li>\n<li>Overall Positive or higher rating on the Steam Store</li>\n<li>High-quality, player-approved titles only</li>\n<li>Perfect for discovering new favorites</li>\n<li>Instant delivery of your game key</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Expand your library with confidence and enjoy the excitement of not knowing what great game you’ll play next. With Grand Random Steam Games, every surprise is backed by proven player satisfaction — making every reveal worth it.</p>",
  "notice": "<p>This product includes <strong>1 Random Steam</strong> Key and can be activated only on the Steam platform.</p><p>If you purchase more than one item, you may receive the same game more than once. Please note that refunds are NOT AVAILABLE for duplicate game keys.</p><p>To minimize the chances of receiving duplicates, we recommend choosing offers from different sellers.</p>",
